anhtung37/\" target=\"_blank\" data-label=\"Instagram\" class=\"icon primary button circle tooltip instagram\" title=\"Follow on Instagram\" aria-label=\"Follow on Instagram\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><i class=\"icon-instagram\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a><a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@tung_vneconomics\" target=\"_blank\" data-label=\"TikTok\" class=\"icon primary button circle tooltip tiktok\" title=\"Follow on TikTok\" aria-label=\"Follow on TikTok\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><i class=\"icon-tiktok\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/ThanhTung78\" data-label=\"Twitter\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"icon primary button circle tooltip twitter\" title=\"Follow on Twitter\" aria-label=\"Follow on Twitter\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><i class=\"icon-twitter\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a><a href=\"mailto:tranthanhtung37@gmail.com\" data-label=\"E-mail\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"icon primary button circle tooltip email\" title=\"Send us an email\" aria-label=\"Send us an email\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><i class=\"icon-envelop\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/tungvungtau/\" data-label=\"Pinterest\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"icon primary button circle tooltip pinterest\" title=\"Follow on Pinterest\" aria-label=\"Follow on Pinterest\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><i class=\"icon-pinterest\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tranthanhtung37/\" data-label=\"LinkedIn\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"icon primary button circle tooltip linkedin\" title=\"Follow on LinkedIn\" aria-label=\"Follow on LinkedIn\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><i class=\"icon-linkedin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@vn-economics\" data-label=\"YouTube\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"icon primary button circle tooltip youtube\" title=\"Follow on YouTube\" aria-label=\"Follow on YouTube\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><i class=\"icon-youtube\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a><a href=\"https://t.me/vneconomics\" data-label=\"Telegram\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"icon primary button circle tooltip telegram\" title=\"Follow on Telegram\" aria-label=\"Follow on Telegram\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><i class=\"icon-telegram\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></div></p>\n<p>\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t</p>\n<p></div></p>\n<p>\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t</div>\n\n\t</p>\n<p></div>\n<p>\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t</section>\n\t<br />\n\n\t<section class=\"section\" id=\"section_1457820360\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section-bg fill\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"944\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/background-01-944x1024-1.png\" class=\"bg attachment- size-\" alt=\"\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"section-content relative\">\n\t\t\t</p>\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-1245311831\"></p>\n<p>\n\t<div id=\"col-1030536690\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</p>\n<header>\n<h2><span data-text-color=\"secondary\">About</span></h2>\n</header>\n<p>I have over 09 years of experience in the Marketing field, specializing in Digital Marketing. I got MBA degree from UEH in 2017 and currently, I am a full-time Digital Marketing Lecturer at University, where I have the opportunity to share my knowledge and expertise with potential marketers.</p>\n<p>Throughout my career, I have developed a strong proficiency in various aspects of Digital Marketing. I possess extensive knowledge and hands-on experience in website development using WordPress, as well as implementing effective SEO strategies to optimize online visibility and drive organic traffic. I am passionate about staying up-to-date with the latest digital trends, tools, and techniques, allowing me to consistently deliver impactful marketing campaigns.</p>\n<p>Moreover, I am deeply fascinated by Blockchain technology and its potential to revolutionize various industries. I firmly believe that Blockchain will play a pivotal role in shaping the future, particularly in the next 10-20 years. I constantly strive to expand my understanding of Blockchain, cryptocurrencies, NFTs, and Web3 applications, as I foresee their immense impact on business models, finance, and even societal structures.</p>\n<p>\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t<br />\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1702101396\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://marketing2student.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"button primary is-shade box-shadow-3 box-shadow-5-hover lowercase\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"border-radius:5px;\">\n\t\t<span>Read more about me</span>\n\t</a>\n</p>\n<p>\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t</p>\n<p></div>\n<p>\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t</section>\n\t<br />\n\n\t<section class=\"section dark\" id=\"section_536183738\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section-bg fill\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"section-content relative\">\n\t\t\t</p>\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-686559050\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1150693357\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</p>\n<h2>Kinh nghiệm</h2>\n<p>\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t</div>\n\n\t\n<p></div><br />\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-998633759\"></p>\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1950301865\" class=\"col medium-2 small-3 large-2\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_494775135\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/kpmg-viet-nam-800x800.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/kpmg-viet-nam-800x800.jpg 800w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/kpmg-viet-nam-400x400.jpg 400w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/kpmg-viet-nam-280x280.jpg 280w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/kpmg-viet-nam-768x768.jpg 768w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/kpmg-viet-nam-510x510.jpg 510w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/kpmg-viet-nam-100x100.jpg 100w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/kpmg-viet-nam.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t</div>\n\t\n<p>\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t<br />\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1081145169\" class=\"col medium-10 small-12 large-10\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</p>\n<h2>Senior Digital Marketing at KPMG In Vietnam (Nov 2021 &#8211; Jun 2022)</h2>\n<p><em>One of Big4 company.</em></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Job Responsibility</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>Digital Marketing tasks</strong><br />&#8211; Website development with Adobe Experience Manager (AEM), using Adobe Analytics to track user behavior in website, work with Global Digital Marketing team to improve website<br />&#8211; CRM: using Microsoft Dynamic 365 to run email marketing campaigns and manage contact<br />&#8211; Paid ads: running Facebook Ads, Google Ads, and Linked In Ads to increase performance</p>\n<p><strong>Growth APP</strong><br />Support team project KPMG OnDemand to grow app installs from 0 to more than 10,000 downloads in 02 months after launching the app</p>\n<p>\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t</p>\n<p></div><br />\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-744485323\"></p>\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1690712055\" class=\"col medium-2 small-3 large-2\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_1601620501\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/avarta-800x800.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/avarta-800x800.png 800w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/avarta-400x400.png 400w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/avarta-280x280.png 280w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/avarta-768x768.png 768w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/avarta-1536x1536.png 1536w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/avarta.png 2048w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/avarta-510x510.png 510w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/avarta-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t</div>\n\t\n<p>\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t<br />\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1880027256\" class=\"col medium-10 small-12 large-10\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</p>\n<h2>Digital Marketing &amp; Association Specialist at VeXeRe (Nov 2020 &#8211; Nov 2021)</h2>\n<p><em>Top #1 in online bus ticket platform &amp; bus management software (SaaS) in Vietnam (vexere.com &amp; bms,vexere.com)</em></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Job Responsibility</strong></h2>\n<p>Manage all Marketing activities for SaaS products of company, especially focus on Digital Marketing channels</p>\n<p><strong>Digital Marketing tasks</strong></p>\n<p>Website development: building website by using Elementor Plugin (WordPress platform)</p>\n<p>SEO<br />&#8211; Content Marketing: write blog, design banner, make video script<br />&#8211; SEO techniques: Onpage, Offpage, SEO Google Map<br />&#8211; Analysis: using Google tools ( Analytics, Search Console, Data Studio, &#8211; Tag Manager, Optimize) SERPROBOT, Ahrefs, Keywordtool.io,&#8230;</p>\n<p>Social Marketing:<br />&#8211; Facebook: write post, manage engagement<br />&#8211; Youtube: upload video, SEO Youtube<br />&#8211; Zalo Official Account: create article, sending broadcast and manage engagement</p>\n<p>Lead management: using CRM tools (Hubspot) and tracking source to improve quality of Lead</p>\n<p><b>Association</b><strong> tasks</strong></p>\n<p>Work with relevant teams to develop and execute online strategies to increase sales of SaaS Products</p>\n<p>Partnership: corporate with partner ( VNPay, Grab, Viettel Post,&#8230;) to run promotion campaign for SaaS Products</p>\n<p>Product Marketing: corporate with Product team and Sales team to launching new Products, new Module of software to customer</p>\n<h2><strong>Achievement</strong></h2>\n<p>Create new structure for Marketing activities &amp; build Customer Journey for SaaS products</p>\n<p>Make more keywords on top of Google Search (ex: <a href=\"https://bms.vexere.com/phan-mem-nha-xe/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Phần mềm nhà xe</a> | <a href=\"https://bms.vexere.com/phan-mem-nha-xe/phan-mem-quan-ly-ban-ve/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Phần mềm quản lý xe khách</a> | <a href=\"https://bms.vexere.com/phan-mem-nha-xe/phan-mem-quan-ly-hang-hoa/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Phần mềm hàng hoá xe khách</a> | <a href=\"https://bms.vexere.com/phan-mem-nha-xe/app-nhan-vien-ban-ve-xe-khach/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">App bán vé xe</a> | <a href=\"https://bms.vexere.com/phan-mem-xe-khach-nhung-van-de-ve-cong-nghe-nha-xe-can-quan-tam/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Phần mềm xe khách</a> | <a href=\"https://bms.vexere.com/vexere-quan-ly-hang-hoa-ung-dung-giup-viec-quan-ly-hang-hoa-hieu-qua/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ứng dụng hàng hoá xe khách</a> | <a href=\"https://bms.vexere.com/phan-mem-nha-xe/tong-dai-ban-ve-cho-xe-khach/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tổng đài bán vé xe khách</a> | <a href=\"https://bms.vexere.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Phần mềm hãng xe</a> | <a href=\"https://bms.vexere.com/phan-mem-nha-xe/ung-dung-mobile-app-cua-nha-xe/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ứng dụng nhà xe</a> | <a href=\"https://bms.vexere.com/phan-mem-nha-xe/website-thuong-hieu-nha-xe/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Website xe khách giá rẻ</a> | <a href=\"https://bms.vexere.com/trien-khai-goi-uu-dai-tin-nhan-sms-brandname-tu-vexere-cho-nha-xe/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SMS cho nhà xe</a>)</p>\n<p>Increase &gt;100% Lead than previous year</p>\n<p>\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t</p>\n<p></div><br />\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-1737436926\"></p>\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1600281563\" class=\"col medium-2 small-3 large-2\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_2089764313\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/30709770_984220618421066_6755088781776257024_n.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/30709770_984220618421066_6755088781776257024_n.png 300w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/30709770_984220618421066_6755088781776257024_n-280x280.png 280w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/30709770_984220618421066_6755088781776257024_n-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t</div>\n\t\n<p>\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t<br />\n\n\t<div id=\"col-640483013\" class=\"col medium-10 small-12 large-10\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</p>\n<h2>Senior Digital Planning Officer at Chailease (Oct 2017 &#8211; Apr 2020)</h2>\n<p><em>Top #1 in Financial Leasing Industry (Credit revenue: ~ $300 mil | Employee: &gt;400) in 2019 (www.chailease.com.vn)</em></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Job Responsibility</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>Digital Marketing Task</strong></p>\n<p><strong>*Online Advertising: Facebook, Zalo, Email marketing &amp; Google Ads</strong></p>\n<p>+ Manage Website/ Facebook Fanpage / Zalo Official Account.<br />\n+ Support Sales Department finding customers (B2B) through these channels.<br />\n+ Coordinate with agencies for Online Advertising campaigns (~$3,000 monthly budget).<br />\n+Use Google Analytics, Google My Business, Google Search Console, Google Tag Manager, Google Data Studio&#8230;to analyze performance of Online Advertising campaigns</p>\n<p><strong>*Content Marketing: Design, SEO &amp; PR articles</strong></p>\n<p>+ Use Photoshop, AI, Proshow, Dreamweaver to create promotion materials: Brochure, Standee, Video,&#8230;<br />\n+ Use CMS to manage all content of website (can responsively display in Desktop &amp; Moblile)<br />\n+ Make keywords reach top of Google Search result (ex: “cho thuê tài chính”, “thuê bao tài chính”, “thuê tài chính”,&#8230;.)<br />\n+ Write monthly PR articles to publish in famous newspapers (cafef.vn, cafebiz.vn, vneconomy.vn,&#8230;)</p>\n<p><strong>Traditional Marketing tasks</strong></p>\n<p>&#8211; In charge of Promotion Campaigns for Dealers to expand customer base for company<br />\n&#8211; Sponsor for events of customers, Dealers or industrial associations. Join suitable exhibition to increase brand awareness and find new potential business opportunities for company<br />\nAchievements:<br />\nSuccess connecting &gt; 80 Dealers to join campaigns.<br />\nHelp company become member of &gt;10 industry associations</p>\n<p><strong>Planning tasks</strong></p>\n<p>+ Set up policies and guidelines related to PR &amp; Marketing activities of company.<br />\n+ Develop KPIs, action plan, annual budget (~USD 50,000 each years) and measure performance; make monthly, quarterly, semi-annually and annually report. Present directly to CEO about PR &amp; Marketing activities of company.</p>\n<h2><strong>Achievements:</strong></h2>\n<p>&#8211; Increase follower from 0 to ~ 5,000 for Facebook and &gt;1,200 for Zalo in 01 year.<br />\n&#8211; Referred &gt; 600 customers to Sale Department with created sale volume &gt;1,200,000 USD<br />\n&#8211; Referred &gt;1,000 CVs to HR department in 02 years.<br />\n&#8211; Maintain ~15,000 visitors monthly access website of company.</p>\n<p>\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t</p>\n<p></div><br />\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-1831775135\"></p>\n\n\t<div id=\"col-336578818\" class=\"col medium-2 small-3 large-2\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_297173703\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/20597263_1516604705069276_5337373954250615015_n-800x800.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/20597263_1516604705069276_5337373954250615015_n-800x800.jpg 800w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/20597263_1516604705069276_5337373954250615015_n-400x400.jpg 400w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/20597263_1516604705069276_5337373954250615015_n-280x280.jpg 280w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/20597263_1516604705069276_5337373954250615015_n-768x768.jpg 768w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/20597263_1516604705069276_5337373954250615015_n-510x510.jpg 510w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/20597263_1516604705069276_5337373954250615015_n-100x100.jpg 100w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/20597263_1516604705069276_5337373954250615015_n.jpg 900w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t</div>\n\t\n<p>\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t<br />\n\n\t<div id=\"col-327589541\" class=\"col medium-10 small-12 large-10\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</p>\n<h2>Marketing Executive at Prime (Dec 2016 &#8211; Sep 2017)</h2>\n<p><em>Top #1 in Ceramic Tiles Industry (Retail Revenue: &gt;$300 mil | Employyee: &gt;3,000) In 2017 (www.prime.vn)</em></p>\n<h2><strong>Job Responsibility</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>Marketing Task</strong></p>\n<p>&#8211; Market research of new products, new marketing activities, price of products of competitors in South market<br />\n&#8211; Manage relationship with ceramic tile distributor by troubleshooting their problems with company, quality of products, sales campaign.<br />\n&#8211; Hold events for top sales distributors &amp; join in industry exhibition to introduce new products of company</p>\n<p>\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t</p>\n<p></div><br />\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-1917281781\"></p>\n\n\t<div id=\"col-865369207\" class=\"col medium-2 small-3 large-2\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_113585880\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"190\" height=\"170\" src=\"https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/CL-Logo-snow.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t</div>\n\t\n<p>\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t<br />\n\n\t<div id=\"col-514189153\" class=\"col medium-10 small-12 large-10\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</p>\n<h2>Sales Executive</h2>\n<h2><strong>Job Responsibility</strong></h2>\n<h3><strong>Task</strong></h3>\n<p>&#8211; Do Sales &amp; Marketing for Capsule Coffee &amp; Machine with Brand Nespresso<br />\n&#8211; Manage product stock to ensure its availability</p>\n<p>\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t</p>\n<p></div></p>\n<p>\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t</section>\n\t<br />\n\n\t<section class=\"section\" id=\"section_112580422\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section-bg fill\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t